          </span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></aside> <div class="flex-1 xlg:px-50 lg:pr-50 min-w-[0px]" data-v-34c96340><div class="mt-[20px]" data-v-34c96340><h1 class="art-title font-bold xlg:text-[36px] lg:text-[36px] md:text-32 sm:text-24" data-v-34c96340>
              JLCPCB Copper Weight (Thickness) Guide
            </h1> <p class="text-999999 mt-12" data-v-34c96340><i class="iconfont icon-time" data-v-34c96340></i>
              Last updated on Dec 15, 2025
            </p> <div class="right-aside pt-20 xlg:hidden lg:hidden" data-v-50055b30 data-v-34c96340><!----></div> <div class="mt-20" data-v-34c96340><div class="rich-preview-wrap" style="line-height: 1.6; font-size: 14px" data-v-34c96340><p style="font-size:16px; text-align:left;"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"> Definition:</span></p><p style="font-size:16px; text-align:left;"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);"> Copper weight (or thickness) in PCB manufacturing is measured in ounces (oz).</span></p><p style="font-size:16px; text-align:justify;"> ● <span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">1oz copper = copper thickness of 35 µm, which is the thickness of 1 oz of copper spread over 1 ft².</span></p><p style="font-size:16px; text-align:left;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);"> </span></p><h3 style="font-size:22px; text-align:left;"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">Available Copper Weights</span></h3><table style="width:auto;"><tbody><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="99.13333333333334">PCB Type</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="124.86666666666666">Layer</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="140">Available Copper Weight</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="252.06666666666666">Notes</td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="99.13333333333334">FR4 PCB</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="124.86666666666666">Outer layer</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="140">1oz, 2oz (standard)</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="252.06666666666666">Heavier options for 2-layer only</td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="99.13333333333334"></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="124.86666666666666">2-layer FR4 only</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="140">2.5oz, 3.5oz, 4.5oz</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="252.06666666666666">Special high-current designs</td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="99.13333333333334"></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="124.86666666666666">Inner layer</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="140">0.5oz (default), 1oz, 2oz</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="252.06666666666666">Availability depends on total layers and overall thickness</td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="99.13333333333334">FPC (Flexible PCB)</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="124.86666666666666">Inner & Outer layers</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="140">1/3oz, 0.5oz, 1oz</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="252.06666666666666">1/3oz used for ultra-thin flexibility</td></tr></tbody></table><p style="font-size:16px; text-align:left;"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">⚠️ Always refer to the actual online order page for current availability and pricing.</span></p><p style="font-size:16px; text-align:left;"><span style="color:rgb(51, 51, 51);"> </span></p><h3 style="font-size:22px; text-align:left;"><span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 0);">Design Rules (Minimum Trace Width / Spacing)</span></h3><table style="width:auto;"><tbody><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="142.13333333333333">Copper Weight</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="184.4">Applicable PCB Type</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="285.53333333333336">Min. Trace Width / Space</td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="142.13333333333333">1oz</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="184.4">1–2 layers FR4</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="285.53333333333336">0.10 mm (4 mil)</td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="142.13333333333333">0.5oz or 1oz</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="184.4">≥ 4 layers FR4</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="285.53333333333336">0.09 mm (3.5 mil); 3 mil available with extra cost</td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="142.13333333333333">2oz</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="184.4">Any layer FR4</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="285.53333333333336">0.16 mm (6.5 mil)</td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="142.13333333333333">2.5oz</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="184.4">2-layer FR4</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="285.53333333333336">0.20 mm (8 mil)</td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="142.13333333333333">3.5oz</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="184.4">2-layer FR4</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="285.53333333333336">0.25 mm (10 mil)</td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="142.13333333333333">4.5oz</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="184.4">2-layer FR4</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="285.53333333333336">0.30 mm (12 mil)</td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="142.13333333333333">0.33oz</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="184.4">FPC</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="285.53333333333336">0.076 mm (3 mil); absolute limit 2 mil, avoid if possible</td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="142.13333333333333">0.5oz</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="184.4">FPC</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="285.53333333333336">0.09 mm (3.5 mil)</td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="142.13333333333333">1oz</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="184.4">FPC</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="285.53333333333336">0.10 mm (4 mil)</td></tr></tbody></table><p style="font-size:16px; font-size:16px;"><br></p><p style="font-size:16px; font-size:16px;"> </p></div></div> <!----> <div class="mt-30" data-v-34c96340><!----></div> <div class="split-line h-1 bg-[#f1f3f6] mt-[25px] mb-[30px]" data-v-34c96340></div> <!----></div></div> <aside class="md:hidden sm:hidden w-[300px] shrink-0 aside-right sticky top-[60px] article self-start" data-v-34c96340><div class="right-aside pt-20" data-v-50055b30 data-v-34c96340><!----></div> <!----></aside></div></div> <!----></div></main> <footer id="frontFooter" class="bg-[#26272A] pt-50 pb-30 md:pt-20 sm:pt-20 text-14 text-white" data-v-4659cd07 data-v-f507df84><div class="jlc-content" data-v-4659cd07><div class="flex justify-between md:hidden sm:hidden" data-v-4659cd07><div class="flex flex-col justify-between" data-v-4659cd07><div class="text-16 font-medium cursor-pointer flex items-center hover:text-primary" d