        </span></a></li><li class="flex-1 text-center" data-v-db1bd370><a href="https://jlcpcb.com/user-center/messages" aria-label="link" class="inline-flex flex-col items-center no-underline gap-[3px]" data-v-db1bd370><i class="iconfont inline-block w-[24px] h-[24px] text-center text-[20px] icon-tab_message_icon text-[#444444]" data-v-db1bd370></i> <span class="text-[12px] leading-[1] text-[#444444]" data-v-db1bd370>
